@startuml system-architecture
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
top to bottom direction
title Minimal LoRA Training Pipeline\nSingle host | SD 1.5 | 100-1,000 images | explicit CPU test backend
actor "User / local GPU tester" as User
component "FastAPI + API keys\nTenant ownership / bounded uploads\nIdempotent jobs / status / cancellation" as API #DBEAFE
database "SQLite\nMetadata + durable stage queue\nAttempts / progress / registry" as DB #DBEAFE
component "Single worker supervisor\nSingleton OS lock\nFair dispatch / watchdog / recovery" as Supervisor #DBEAFE
component "CPU stage subprocesses\nVERIFY / PREPARE / template CAPTION\nPUBLISH" as CPU #E2E8F0
node "Physical GPU slots on one host\nDefault: one RTX 4060 Ti 16GB\nOptional BLIP | TRAIN | EVALUATE\nOne stage per physical GPU UUID\nProcess-group identity + device OS lock" as GPU #F3E8FF
storage "Local persistent volume\nImmutable upload objects and manifests\nCheckpoints / adapters / images / reports\nAtomic writes + SHA-256" as Files #E0F2FE
component "Model registry\nUNVERIFIED: explicit opt-in download\nREADY: calibrated policy + load test passed" as Registry #DCFCE7
component "Inference / A-B report\nCompatible SD 1.5 base + adapter\nPaired prompts, seeds and settings" as Consumer #DCFCE7
component "Logs + health + metrics\nQueue / steps / memory / retries\nBenchmark definitions, no invented results" as Metrics #FEF3C7

User --> API : 1  Upload manifest and bytes\nSubmit / poll / cancel
API --> DB : 2  Atomic admission\nand task creation
API -right-> Files : Stream bounded uploads\nFreeze exact objects
Supervisor --> DB : Claim / heartbeat / guarded completion
Supervisor --> CPU : 3  CPU dispatch
Supervisor --> GPU : 4  Shared GPU dispatch
CPU --> Files : Clean / group / split / caption
GPU --> Files : 5  Train / checkpoint / generate\nEvaluate exact saved adapter
CPU --> Registry : 6  Register verified references
Registry --> DB : Unique model per job\nGuard cancellation and attempt
Registry --> Consumer : 7  Authorized artifact handoff
Registry --> Files : Checksummed manifest references
API --> Registry : Owner-scoped lookup
Supervisor ..> Metrics
GPU ..> Metrics

legend bottom left
  API and supervisor are separate processes; all persistent volumes are host-local.
  GPU cycle: EVALUATE, TRAIN, CAPTION, TRAIN; owner round-robin within each class.
  CPU fake slots are test-only and never map multiple slots to one real GPU.
  No calibrated policy: COMPLETED_UNVERIFIED, never an implied quality guarantee.
  Multi-host failover and automatic quality remediation are deferred; see trade-offs.
endlegend
@enduml
